WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.644
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.644 --> 00:12.446
all:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
全部：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.446 --> 00:13.914
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.914 --> 00:15.716
all:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
全部：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.716 --> 00:18.752
- * OHH...
-*哦...

00:18.752 --> 00:20.988
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.988 --> 00:22.990
all:
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
全部：
* 海绵宝宝

00:22.990 --> 00:25.059
- * ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:25.059 --> 00:26.727
all:
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
全部：
* 海绵宝宝

00:26.727 --> 00:29.063
- * IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
- * 如果是航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:29.063 --> 00:30.564
all:
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
全部：
* 海绵宝宝

00:30.564 --> 00:33.033
- * THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
- * 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:33.033 --> 00:34.968
all: * SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
- READY?
所有：* 海绵宝宝
- 准备好了吗？

00:34.968 --> 00:37.004
all:
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
全部：
* 海绵宝宝

00:37.004 --> 00:38.939
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
* 海绵宝宝

00:38.939 --> 00:40.908
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS
* 海绵宝宝

00:40.908 --> 00:42.143
- * SPONGEBOB...
- * 海绵宝宝...

00:42.143 --> 00:44.445
* SQUAREPANTS
* 方裤

00:44.445 --> 00:46.914
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.914 --> 00:49.217
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:49.217 --> 00:50.718
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.221 --> 00:56.224
[cheery ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:56.224 --> 01:02.296
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:05.466 --> 01:08.636
- AH, YES,
JUST HOW I LIKE IT--
- 啊，是的，
我就是喜欢它——

01:08.636 --> 01:10.938
NICE AND EMPTY.
漂亮又空虚。

01:10.938 --> 01:13.474
- HEY, I'M STILL HERE.
- 嘿，我还在这里。

01:13.474 --> 01:15.143
- OH, YES, SIRREE.
- 哦，是的，先生。

01:15.143 --> 01:19.713
NICE AND EMPTY.
漂亮又空虚。

01:19.713 --> 01:22.716
[Hawaiian string music]
[夏威夷弦乐]

01:22.716 --> 01:25.353
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:25.353 --> 01:26.354
- DO YOU WORK HERE?
- 你在这里工作吗？

01:26.354 --> 01:27.821
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

01:27.821 --> 01:30.658
WELCOME TO THE KRUSTY--
[sputters]
欢迎来到 Krusty——
[溅射声]

01:30.658 --> 01:32.160
[overlapping muttering]
[重叠的嘀咕声]

01:32.160 --> 01:33.861
WELL, THERE GOES MY NAP.
好了，我的小睡去啦。

01:33.861 --> 01:36.664
[hornpipe music]
MULTIPLE ORDERS UP! SPONGEBOB!
[喇叭音乐]
多份订单！海绵宝宝！

01:36.664 --> 01:38.899
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

01:38.899 --> 01:40.201
WHERE ARE YOU?
你在哪里？

01:40.201 --> 01:42.436
YOU NEED TO GET OUT HERE
AND MAKE THOSE KRABBY PATTIES!
你需要离开这里
制作蟹肉饼！

01:42.436 --> 01:45.373
- [jabbers happily]
- [高兴地叽叽喳喳]

01:49.943 --> 01:52.746
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

01:52.746 --> 01:54.882
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

01:54.882 --> 01:58.752
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

02:00.988 --> 02:02.323
GET IT TOGETHER,
SPONGEBOB.
把它放在一起，
海绵宝宝。

02:02.323 --> 02:04.825
THE DINING ROOM IS
FULL OF RAVENOUS CUSTOMERS.
餐厅是
到处都是贪婪的顾客。

02:04.825 --> 02:06.727
- [cries like a monkey]
- [像猴子一样哭]

02:08.996 --> 02:11.765
- I GOT IT.
- 我得到了它。

02:17.371 --> 02:18.939
[whistles]
[口哨声]

02:18.939 --> 02:20.040
- HMM.
- 唔。

02:20.040 --> 02:22.210
WHAT WAS THAT IMBECILE DOING
IN THERE?
那个白痴在做什么
在那里？

02:22.210 --> 02:24.478
AN OLD BOOK?
一本旧书？

02:24.478 --> 02:28.216
- [gasps]
NOTHING.
- [喘气]
什么都没有。

02:28.216 --> 02:31.084
- WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?
- 这是怎么回事？

02:47.801 --> 02:50.037
- THANK YOU.
- 谢谢。

02:58.346 --> 03:00.047
- EXCUSE ME.
- 打扰一下。

03:00.047 --> 03:02.616
I WANTED PICKLES ON MINE.
我想要我的泡菜。

03:06.820 --> 03:08.088
- HMM.
- 唔。

03:08.088 --> 03:10.824
IF SPONGE-BRAIN IS KEEPING
THE BOOK AWAY FROM ME,
如果海绵脑继续存在
这本书远离我，

03:10.824 --> 03:13.093
THEN I HAVE NO CHOICE
BUT TO READ IT.
那我别无选择
但要阅读它。

03:13.093 --> 03:14.695
[door opens,
footsteps approaching]
[门打开，
脚步声逼近]

03:14.695 --> 03:17.130
- I'LL TAKE THAT,
THANK YOU.
- 我会接受的，
谢谢。

03:19.733 --> 03:21.134
- THERE HE GOES AGAIN,
- 他又来了，

03:21.134 --> 03:23.437
SCRIBBLING AWAY
IN THAT LITTLE BOOK.
乱写乱画
在那本小书中。

03:23.437 --> 03:26.574
I MUST ADMIT,
MY CURIOSITY IS PIQUED.
我必须承认，
我的好奇心被激起了。

03:26.574 --> 03:30.311
I GUESS I'M PIQUED
TO PEEK AT THAT BOOK.
我想我很生气
看看那本书。

03:30.311 --> 03:33.547
[laughs]
[笑]

03:33.547 --> 03:35.449
OH, FUN.
哦，有趣。

03:35.449 --> 03:36.917
- HUH?
- 嗯？

03:36.917 --> 03:41.289
- HEY, SPONGEBOB,
YOU NEED TO MAKE A DELIVERY.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝，
您需要送货。

03:41.289 --> 03:43.591
- OKEYDOKEY.
- 奥基多基。

03:43.591 --> 03:44.758
- THE ADDRESS IS ON THE BAG.
- 地址在袋子上。

03:44.758 --> 03:46.059
- I GOT IT.
- 我得到了它。

03:46.059 --> 03:49.297
- [whistles]
- [口哨]

03:49.297 --> 03:51.732
[gasps]
IT'S A DIARY!
[喘气]
这是一本日记！

03:51.732 --> 03:52.966
OH-HO-HO.
噢-嗬-嗬。

03:52.966 --> 03:54.968
THIS IS GONNA BE GOOD.
HUH?
这会很好的。
嗯？

03:54.968 --> 03:56.103
DRAT, IT'S LOCKED.
糟糕，它被锁了。

03:56.103 --> 03:57.405
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:57.405 --> 04:00.474
HMM.
I NEED A HAIRPIN.
唔。
我需要一个发夹。

04:05.313 --> 04:07.581
[heavenly choir sings a chord]
[天堂合唱团唱出和弦]

04:07.581 --> 04:10.818
AND NOW
THE DIARY OF A MORON.
现在
白痴日记。

04:10.818 --> 04:13.387
"DEAR DIARY,
WHAT AN AMAZING..."
“亲爱的日记，
多么神奇啊……”

04:13.387 --> 04:14.655
[SpongeBob narrating]
DAY I'VE HAD.
【海绵宝宝旁白】
我度过的一天。

04:14.655 --> 04:16.390
THIS MORNING I WAS GREETED
今天早上我受到了欢迎

04:16.390 --> 04:19.327
BY MY NEAREST AND DEAREST
NEIGHBOR, SQUIDWARD.
来自我最亲近的人
邻居，章鱼哥。

04:19.327 --> 04:22.896
HE HAD SOME VERY IMPORTANT NEWS
HE WAS JUST BURSTING TO SHARE.
他有一些非常重要的消息
他迫不及待地想分享。

04:22.896 --> 04:25.433
HE HAD DECIDED THAT TODAY
WOULD BE THE PERFECT DAY
他今天就决定了
这将是完美的一天

04:25.433 --> 04:27.335
TO DELIVER
HIS PROFOUND OPINIONS
交付
他的深刻见解

04:27.335 --> 04:30.438
ON HOW TO PROPERLY RAISE
AND CARE FOR A HOUSEHOLD PET...
关于如何正确提高
并照顾家庭宠物...

04:30.438 --> 04:31.739
- [spits]
- [吐口水]

04:31.739 --> 04:35.242
- SPECIFICALLY,
WHAT NOT TO FEED THEM.
- 具体来说，
什么不能喂它们。

04:35.242 --> 04:37.611
THE LIST WAS VERY THOROUGH.
清单非常详尽。

04:37.611 --> 04:40.013
NEEDLESS TO SAY,
THIS IS ALL VERY ENLIGHTENING.
不用说，
这一切都非常有启发性。

04:40.013 --> 04:41.449
IT WARMS MY HEART
它温暖了我的心

04:41.449 --> 04:43.851
TO KNOW THAT SQUIDWARD THINKS
WE'RE CLOSE ENOUGH
了解章鱼哥的想法
我们已经足够接近了

04:43.851 --> 04:46.487
TO USE THE HARSHEST WORDS
IN HIS CRITIQUE--
使用最严厉的言语
在他的批评中——

04:46.487 --> 04:48.756
HORRIBLE WORDS THAT SHOULD
NEVER BE USED AROUND STRANGERS,
应该说的可怕的话
切勿在陌生人身边使用，

04:48.756 --> 04:49.857
WHO MAY NOT KNOW
谁可能不知道

04:49.857 --> 04:51.659
HOW WELL-INTENTIONED
THOSE WORDS ARE.
多么用心良苦
这些话是。

04:51.659 --> 04:53.527
KNOWING I HAVE A TENDENCY
TO DAWDLE,
知道我有一种倾向
闲逛，

04:53.527 --> 04:54.795
GARY CUT
OUR CONVERSATION SHORT.
加里·卡特
我们的谈话很简短。

04:54.795 --> 04:55.963
[alarm bell rings]
[警钟响起]

04:55.963 --> 04:58.532
AND I WAS HURRIED
ALONG TO WORK
我很着急
一起工作

04:58.532 --> 05:00.501
WHERE I ARRIVED ONLY
AN HOUR AND A HALF EARLY
仅我到达的地方
提前一个半小时

05:00.501 --> 05:03.203
FOR WHAT MAY BE
MY FAVORITE DAY OF THE YEAR--
可能会发生什么
我一年中最喜欢的一天——

05:03.203 --> 05:04.605
CLEANING DAY!
清洁日！

05:04.605 --> 05:06.407
TOGETHER,
MR. KRABS AND I SCRUBBED
在一起，
先生。我和螃蟹擦洗

05:06.407 --> 05:08.609
EVERY INCH OF THE KRUSTY KRAB.
蟹堡蟹的每一寸。

05:08.609 --> 05:10.378
AND FINALLY,
WITH A LITTLE ELBOW GREASE,
最后，
用一点肘部油脂，

05:10.378 --> 05:12.846
WE WERE ABLE TO GET INTO
EVEN THE TIGHTEST SPOTS.
我们能够进入
即使是最紧张的地方。

05:12.846 --> 05:16.283
AH, YES,
CLEANING DAY.
啊，是的，
清洁日。

05:16.283 --> 05:18.386
- GREAT NEPTUNE!
- 伟大的海王星！

05:18.386 --> 05:19.920
I HAD NO IDEA!
我不知道！

05:19.920 --> 05:24.425
THE DEPTH OF HIS DELUSION
IS AWE-INSPIRING!
他的错觉有多深
令人惊叹！

05:24.425 --> 05:25.726
- WELL, I DON'T KNOW.
- 嗯，我不知道。

05:25.726 --> 05:27.395
SOMETHING
ABOUT THIS DELIVERY ADDRESS
某事
关于此送货地址

05:27.395 --> 05:28.729
DOESN'T SEEM RIGHT.
看起来不对。

05:28.729 --> 05:30.598
[gasps]
WAIT A MINUTE.
[喘气]
等一下。

05:30.598 --> 05:32.600
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

05:32.600 --> 05:35.068
HE MUST HAVE BEEN THE VICTIM
OF A PRANK PHONE CALL.
他一定是受害者
一个恶作剧电话。

05:35.068 --> 05:36.404
POOR SQUIDWARD.
可怜的章鱼哥。

05:36.404 --> 05:38.105
HE CAN BE SO GULLIBLE.
他就是这么容易受骗。

05:38.105 --> 05:40.240
- OH, BOY!
- 哦，孩子！

05:40.240 --> 05:41.909
A KETCHUP PACKET!
一包番茄酱！

05:41.909 --> 05:44.978
THAT'LL GO GREAT
ON THIS OLD DIAPER.
那会很棒的
在这个旧尿布上。

05:44.978 --> 05:46.246
- OH, SQUIDWARD!
- 哦，章鱼哥！

05:46.246 --> 05:49.316
YOU ARE GONNA LAUGH WHEN
YOU HEAR WHAT I'VE...BEEN.
你会笑的时候
你听到我曾经……经历过什么。

05:49.316 --> 05:51.018
SQUIDWARD?
WHERE ARE YOU?
章鱼哥？
你在哪里？

05:51.018 --> 05:52.420
COULD HAVE SWORE
I JUST SAW HIM.
本来可以发誓
我刚刚看到他。

05:52.420 --> 05:53.754
- SPONGEBOB, UH,
- 海绵宝宝，呃，

05:53.754 --> 05:55.222
ONE OF THE CUSTOMERS
DROPPED HIS WATCH IN A TOILET
其中一位顾客
手表掉进厕所了

05:55.222 --> 05:56.924
AND I NEED YOU
TO FISH IT OUT.
我需要你
把它捞出来。

05:56.924 --> 05:59.159
- DUTY CALLS.
- 值班。

06:02.896 --> 06:06.834
- [laughs]
- [笑]

06:10.303 --> 06:12.740
[coughs]
[咳嗽]

06:12.740 --> 06:14.542
- YOU LAUGHING AT ME?
- 你在笑我吗？

06:14.542 --> 06:16.309
- WHAT? OH, NO.
NO, NO, NO.
- 什么？哦，不。
不，不，不。

06:16.309 --> 06:18.446
I WAS JUST READING WHAT
SPONGEBOB WROTE IN HIS DIARY.
我刚刚读了什么
海绵宝宝在日记中写道。

06:18.446 --> 06:19.580
IT'S HILARIOUS.
太搞笑了。

06:19.580 --> 06:22.450
- READING
SOMEBODY ELSE'S DIARY--
- 阅读
别人的日记——

06:22.450 --> 06:24.351
THAT'S TERRIBLE!
太糟糕了！

06:24.351 --> 06:25.453
TELL ME MORE.
告诉我更多。

06:25.453 --> 06:26.754
- IT SAYS HERE,
- 这里说，

06:26.754 --> 06:28.822
WHEN SPONGEBOB SEES PLAID,
当海绵宝宝看到格子图案时，

06:28.822 --> 06:32.092
HE HAS THIS UNCONTROLLABLE URGE
TO CLUCK LIKE A CHICKEN.
他有一种无法控制的冲动
像鸡一样咯咯叫。

06:32.092 --> 06:35.796
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

06:35.796 --> 06:37.465
- DID SOMEBODY SAY "PLAID"?
- 有人说“格子”吗？

06:37.465 --> 06:38.966
WHY, I'M A PLAID ENTHUSIAST.
为什么，我是格纹爱好者。

06:38.966 --> 06:41.201
I JUST GOT ME NEW KILT TODAY.
我今天刚买了一条新苏格兰短裙。

06:41.201 --> 06:42.670
- OH, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，海绵宝宝。

06:42.670 --> 06:43.904
CAN YOU COME HERE, PLEASE?
请你到这里来好吗？

06:43.904 --> 06:46.306
- I COULDN'T FIND
THAT WATCH ANYWHERE.
- 我找不到
随时随地观看。

06:46.306 --> 06:47.641
ALL I FOUND WAS THIS STUFF.
我发现的就是这个东西。

06:47.641 --> 06:48.709
- I FELL IN.
- 我掉进去了。

06:48.709 --> 06:50.077
- AND THAT GUY.
- 还有那个人。

06:50.077 --> 06:52.680
- WHAT DO YOU THINK
OF MR. KRABS' NEW PLAID KILT?
- 你觉得怎么样
先生。 KRABS 的新格子短裙？

06:52.680 --> 06:56.049
- P-P-P-P-PLAID?
- P-P-P-P-格子？

06:56.049 --> 06:57.851
- HEY!
[crash]
- 嘿！
[碰撞]

06:57.851 --> 07:01.154
- [clucking]
- [咯咯笑]

07:01.154 --> 07:03.190
[crows like a rooster]
[像公鸡一样乌鸦]

07:03.190 --> 07:05.793
- WELL, YOU DON'T HAVE
TO BE NASTY ABOUT IT!
- 好吧，你没有
对此感到讨厌！

07:05.793 --> 07:08.496
- [clucking]
- [咯咯笑]

07:08.496 --> 07:10.731
AVERT YOUR EYES, SQUAREPANTS.
转移你的眼睛，方裤。

07:10.731 --> 07:13.333
I HAVE TO TAKE MY BREAK!
我得休息一下！

07:15.869 --> 07:19.272
[inhales, exhales deeply]
[吸气，深呼气]

07:19.272 --> 07:20.508
[sighs]
[叹气]

07:20.508 --> 07:21.642
- LISTEN TO THIS.
- 听听这个。

07:21.642 --> 07:25.245
SPONGEBOB HAS NAMED
HIS SPATULA "FIFI."
海绵宝宝已命名
他的抹刀“FIFI”。

07:25.245 --> 07:28.315
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:28.315 --> 07:29.783
- HE NAMED IT FIFI.
- 他把它命名为菲菲。

07:29.783 --> 07:32.052
- HE NAMED HIS SPATULA FIFI.
- 他把他的抹刀命名为菲菲。

07:32.052 --> 07:33.020
FIFI.
菲菲。

07:33.020 --> 07:35.288
WHAT KIND OF NAME IS FIFI?
FIFI 是什么样的名字？

07:35.288 --> 07:38.125
- [laughing wildly]
- [狂笑]

07:38.125 --> 07:41.762
WHO EVER HEARD
OF NAMING A SPATULA FIFI?
谁听过
命名抹刀菲菲？

07:41.762 --> 07:43.163
IT'S A GIRL'S NAME!
这是一个女孩的名字！

07:43.163 --> 07:44.932
RIGHT, FRANK?
对吧，弗兰克？

07:44.932 --> 07:46.934
- I'M BACK FROM MY BREAK.
ANY ORDERS, SQUIDWARD?
- 我休息回来了。
有什么命令吗，章鱼哥？

07:46.934 --> 07:50.237
- YEAH, COOK ME UP
A KRABBY PATTY.
- 是的，给我做饭
蟹肉饼。

07:50.237 --> 07:53.440
WITH GOOD OLD FIFI.
和老菲菲一起。

07:53.440 --> 07:54.542
- [shudders]
- [颤抖]

07:54.542 --> 07:57.545
OH, SURE THING.
哦，当然可以。

07:57.545 --> 07:59.913
FIFI, HOW DID PATRICK KNOW
YOUR NAME?
菲菲，帕特里克怎么知道的
你的名字？

07:59.913 --> 08:01.749
HAVE YOU BEEN TALKING?
你一直在说话吗？

08:01.749 --> 08:03.551
- OH, OH, THIS IS
THE BEST ONE YET.
- 哦，哦，这是
迄今为止最好的一个。

08:03.551 --> 08:04.785
GET THIS.
得到这个。

08:04.785 --> 08:07.555
"IF I HEAR THE BIKINI BOTTOM
MUNICIPAL ANTHEM,
“如果我听到比基尼泳裤
市歌，

08:07.555 --> 08:10.423
"I CAN'T HELP BUT TAKE OFF
ALL MY CLOTHES
“我忍不住要起飞
我所有的衣服

08:10.423 --> 08:13.160
AND DANCE AROUND
IN MY UNDERWEAR!"
跳舞
在我的内衣里！”

08:13.160 --> 08:14.194
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:14.194 --> 08:15.796
QUIET, QUIET, QUIET.
安静，安静，安静。

08:15.796 --> 08:17.330
WATCH THIS.
注意这个。

08:17.330 --> 08:20.601
[anthem music plays]
[国歌音乐响起]

08:20.601 --> 08:28.576
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:35.583 --> 08:38.619
[laughter, music stops]
[笑声，音乐停止]

08:38.619 --> 08:40.988
- MY DIARY!
- 我的日记！

08:40.988 --> 08:43.356
SQUIDWARD!
HOW COULD YOU?
章鱼哥！
你怎么能？

08:43.356 --> 08:45.859
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:45.859 --> 08:47.895
[crying]
[哭泣]

08:47.895 --> 08:52.199
[clucks, cries]
[咯咯声、哭声]

08:52.199 --> 08:53.333
- HA.
- 哈。

08:53.333 --> 08:54.935
- THAT WAS
THAT LITTLE DUDE'S DIARY?
- 那是
那个小家伙的日记？

08:54.935 --> 08:56.403
[door slams]
[关门声]

08:56.403 --> 08:57.938
[overlapping murmuring]
- THAT IS NOT OKAY.
[重叠的低语]
- 那不行。

08:57.938 --> 09:00.207
- THAT WAS UNCOOL.
- THAT'S LOW, SQUIDWARD...
- 这太不酷了。
- 太低了，章鱼哥……

09:00.207 --> 09:01.474
EVEN FOR YOU.
即使是为了你。

09:01.474 --> 09:03.176
YOU'D BETTER APOLOGIZE.
你最好道歉。

09:03.176 --> 09:06.479
- [scoffs]
HE'LL GET OVER IT.
- [嘲笑]
他会克服它的。

09:06.479 --> 09:08.148
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

09:08.148 --> 09:11.151
- [scatting]
- [分散]

09:11.151 --> 09:14.421
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

09:14.421 --> 09:16.890
- EXTRA, EXTRA,
READ ALL ABOUT IT!
- 额外，额外，
阅读所有相关内容！

09:16.890 --> 09:18.626
JERK READS DIARY.
混蛋读日记。

09:18.626 --> 09:20.928
LOCAL FRY COOK DEVASTATED.
当地的油炸厨师遭受重创。

09:20.928 --> 09:22.429
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，男孩。

09:22.429 --> 09:24.331
LET ME SEE ONE OF THOSE PAPERS.
让我看看其中一篇论文。

09:24.331 --> 09:26.299
MM-HMM, MM-HMM.
MM-HMM，MM-HMM。
MM-HMM，MM-HMM。
MM-HMM，MM-HMM。
MM-HMM，MM-HMM。
MM-HMM，MM-HMM。
MM-HMM，MM-HMM。
MM-HMM，MM-HMM。

09:26.299 --> 09:30.170
HA HA!
哈哈！

09:30.170 --> 09:32.272
TAXI.
出租车。

09:32.272 --> 09:34.207
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

09:34.207 --> 09:36.476
- WHOA, WHOA, WHOA.
HOLD IT, PAL.
- 哇，哇，哇。
坚持住，朋友。

09:36.476 --> 09:38.278
YOU'RE THAT DIARY READER.
你就是那个日记读者。

09:38.278 --> 09:39.546
- YES, I AM.
- 我是。

09:39.546 --> 09:40.648
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

09:40.648 --> 09:44.685
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

09:44.685 --> 09:46.787
- DIARY THIEF!
- JERK!
- 日记小偷！
- 混蛋！

09:46.787 --> 09:48.856
- SECRET STEALER!
- 秘密窃贼！

09:48.856 --> 09:52.392
- BILLY, STAY AWAY FROM
THAT MEAN, OLD DIARY READER.
- 比利，远离
这意味着，老日记读者。

09:52.392 --> 09:54.662
- MORONS.
- 白痴。

09:54.662 --> 09:56.529
- SQUIDWARD TENTACLES,
- 章鱼哥触手，

09:56.529 --> 09:58.666
BY READING
ANOTHER PERSON'S DIARY,
通过阅读
另一个人的日记，

09:58.666 --> 10:01.068
YOU HAVE VIOLATED THE TERMS
OF YOUR LOAN.
您违反了条款
您的贷款。

10:01.068 --> 10:03.536
WE ARE REPOSSESSING
YOUR HOUSE.
我们正在收回
你的房子。

10:03.536 --> 10:06.774
- [coughs] WHAT?
- TAKE IT AWAY, BOYS.
- [咳嗽] 什么？
- 把它拿走，孩子们。

10:11.378 --> 10:13.847
[thunder booms]
[雷霆轰鸣]

10:16.416 --> 10:19.352
- OW.
-哦。

10:24.992 --> 10:26.093
[club bangs]
- HEY!
[俱乐部刘海]
- 嘿！

10:26.093 --> 10:27.695
YOU CAN'T SLEEP HERE, FELLA.
你不能睡在这里，伙计。

10:27.695 --> 10:29.262
[horn honks]
WAIT A SECOND.
[喇叭鸣响]
等一下。

10:29.262 --> 10:30.898
YOU'RE THAT DIARY READER.
你就是那个日记读者。

10:30.898 --> 10:32.565
I HAD A DIARY ONCE.
我曾经有一本日记。

10:32.565 --> 10:34.668
MY BROTHER READ IT!
我哥哥读了！

10:34.668 --> 10:36.937
I HAD A BROTHER ONCE!
我曾经有一个兄弟！

10:36.937 --> 10:38.305
COME ON, FELLA!
来吧，伙计！

10:38.305 --> 10:41.608
WE HAVE A SPECIAL PLACE
FOR PEOPLE LIKE YOU!
我们有一个特别的地方
对于像您这样的人！

10:44.111 --> 10:45.245
- DIARY READER!
- 日记阅读器！

10:45.245 --> 10:47.280
- WHAT?
YOU READ IT TOO.
- 什么？
你也读过。

10:47.280 --> 10:48.548
- OH, SURE.
- 哦，当然。

10:48.548 --> 10:50.583
BLAME EVERYONE BUT YOURSELF.
责怪所有人，除了你自己。

10:50.583 --> 10:52.252
OH, THAT IS SO YOU.
哦，那就是你。

10:52.252 --> 10:54.054
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:54.054 --> 10:55.422
- HI, SQUIDWARD.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

10:55.422 --> 10:58.125
HOW'S IT GOING?
- SPONGEBOB, OH, THANK GOODNESS.
怎么样了？
- 海绵宝宝，噢，谢天谢地。

10:58.125 --> 11:01.028
YOU HAVE TO FORGIVE ME.
- WHAT FOR?
你必须原谅我。
- 做什么的？

11:01.028 --> 11:04.131
- FOR READING YOUR DIARY.
- OH, THAT.
- 用于阅读您的日记。
- 哦，那个。

11:04.131 --> 11:05.999
YOU KNOW, SQUIDWARD,
EVERYONE WAS SO AMUSED BY IT,
你知道，章鱼哥，
大家都被逗乐了，

11:05.999 --> 11:07.267
I HAD IT PUBLISHED.
我已经发布了。

11:07.267 --> 11:08.802
IT'S A BEST SELLER.
这是畅销书。

11:08.802 --> 11:10.037
AND I OWE IT ALL TO YOU.
我把这一切都归功于你。

11:10.037 --> 11:12.873
BESIDES, YOU ONLY READ
MY WORK DIARY.
此外，您只阅读
我的工作日记。

11:12.873 --> 11:16.076
YOU'VE NEVER EVEN SEEN
MY SECRET PERSONAL DIARY.
你从未见过
我的秘密个人日记。

11:16.076 --> 11:18.445
NOW, THAT WOULD HAVE BEEN
REALLY EMBARRASSING.
现在，本来就是
真的很尴尬。

11:18.445 --> 11:21.281
- THERE HE IS--
THE DIARY READER!
- 他在那里--
日记阅读器！

11:21.281 --> 11:23.583
LET'S GET HIM!
all: YEAH!
让我们抓住他！
所有人：是啊！

11:23.583 --> 11:24.752
- PEOPLE! PEOPLE!
- 人们！人们！

11:24.752 --> 11:26.153
STOP YOUR ASSAULT!
停止你的攻击！

11:26.153 --> 11:29.757
THROUGH MY ART, AS AN AUTHOR,
I HAVE FORGIVEN SQUIDWARD.
作为一名作家，通过我的艺术，
我已经原谅了章鱼哥。

11:29.757 --> 11:30.991
- OH, YEAH?
- 哦，是吗？

11:30.991 --> 11:34.127
DID YOU KNOW HE'S READING
YOUR PERSONAL DIARY?
你知道他在读书吗
您的个人日记？

11:34.127 --> 11:35.562
- [laughing]
- [笑]

11:35.562 --> 11:37.765
- SQUIDWARD!
HOW COULD YOU?
- 章鱼哥！
你怎么能？

11:37.765 --> 11:40.467
[crying]
[哭泣]

11:40.467 --> 11:44.071
[murmuring angrily]
[愤怒地低语]

11:44.071 --> 11:45.305
- I DON'T CARE.
- 我不在乎。

11:45.305 --> 11:47.808
THIS IS SO WORTH IT.
这太值得了。

11:47.808 --> 11:50.878
[laughing]
[笑]

11:53.814 --> 11:56.817
[hornpipe music]
[喇叭音乐]

[喇叭音乐]